  fhir:text [
     fhir:status [ fhir:v "generated" ] ;
     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap jp-condition-disease-outcome-hl70241-to-receipt</b></p><a name=\"jp-condition-disease-outcome-hl70241-to-receipt\"> </a><a name=\"hcjp-condition-disease-outcome-hl70241-to-receipt\"> </a><p>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-jp-condition-disease-outcome-hl70241-cs.html\">http://jpfhir.jp/fhir/core/CodeSystem/HL70241</a> to <a href=\"CodeSystem-jp-condition-disease-outcome-receipt-cs.html\">http://jpfhir.jp/fhir/core/CodeSystem/JP_ConditionDiseaseOutcomeReceipt_CS</a></p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-jp-condition-disease-outcome-hl70241-cs.html\">JP Core Condition Disease Outcome HL7 Table 0241 - Patient Outcome CodeSystemversion: 1.3.0-dev)</a> to <a href=\"CodeSystem-jp-condition-disease-outcome-receipt-cs.html\">JP Core Condition Disease Outcome Receipt CodeSystem</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>D (死亡)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>3 (死亡)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>R (回復)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>2 (治ゆ)</td><td>「治ゆ」は完全回復を指すため、「回復（R）」より狭義。F（完全回復）のみが equivalent。</td></tr><tr><td>N (回復せず／変わらない)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>1 (治ゆ、死亡、中止以外)</td><td>「1：治ゆ・死亡・中止以外」は継続中全般を示すため wider。悪化（W）や後遺症（S）も #1 に含まれる。</td></tr><tr><td>W (悪化)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>1 (治ゆ、死亡、中止以外)</td><td>レセプト電算に悪化の直接対応コードがないため「継続（#1）」にマップ。情報が失われる。</td></tr><tr><td>S (後遺症)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>1 (治ゆ、死亡、中止以外)</td><td>レセプト電算に後遺症の直接対応コードがないため「継続（#1）」にマップ。</td></tr><tr><td>F (完全に回復した)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>2 (治ゆ)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>U (未知)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>1 (治ゆ、死亡、中止以外)</td><td>不明な転帰の暫定値。実際の転帰確認後に適切なコードに更新すること。</td></tr></table></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
